li-5-p2 = prose (cons "- Having measured typical children copying what they knew was silly, the conclusion drawn: autistic children “miss out on a wealth of social learning opportunities”." (cons "- Having measured more logically consistent choices, De Martino: autistic subjects “fail to incorporate emotional context”; the group asked whether this “hyper-rationality” underlies “rigidity and social impairment”." (cons "- The norm is the reference, so leaving it is coded as disorder by construction. The measuring instrument is the illness. Norma is the carpenter's square: normal means squared, not right." (cons "- The field measures the wrong flexibility: following a changing social context, moving with the group. The immobility at issue is inferential: being unable to move off the frame the group holds. Asch's conformers changed answers easily; their judgment could not hold its own position." nil))))
